+The override is not an exemption; it is the composition duty stated verbatim at
+`docs/compiler-policy-interfaces.md:171-173` - "A nil-merge with a required final result
+passes an **optional intermediate destination** to the optional left operand's
+conversion." - with `j-prepared-value-design.md:135-137` and the repository's own SW04
+work item (`docs/investigations/architecture-round-1/swift-checkpoint-todo.md:39-42`).
+The planner rule at `compiler-policy-interfaces.md:155-157` is untouched: the override
+changes *which destination is presented* at one conversion, not what `prepare` does with
+the destination it is given. Verified: `SwiftArrayBoundary.hx` is byte-identical before
